_**Get your Early Bird Tickets this Month only!**_ [![Bassidi Kone Drumming Workshops Sunshine Coast](/media/2014/05/BassidiKoné-Poster-2014-1.jpg)](/media/2014/05/BassidiKoné-Poster-2014-1.jpg)Bassidi Kone will return this June/July for a fantastic World Music Tour down the East Coast. Performances and workshops will be held throughout Brisbane, Sunshine Coast, Gold Coast and Byron Bay. Performances will be accompanied by Nathaniel Combs and the Hayden Hack Infusion. Bassidi and his group Bwazan have just released their third album and this will be available for purchase at the listed events. The following African drumming workshops are for adults and children 8+ years old. Bookings are essential. Email info@rhythmculture.com.au for more information.

Bassidi Koné is an incredible performer and a supportive teacher with an infectious smile.

